  "synthetic": "A declared mutation of named frozen inputs, built only in a disposable copy by whoever runs the oracle. Nothing in this file creates or edits a live record.",
  "oracle_rule": "A case passes only on the listed facts with their basis and source links, and on the absence of every forbidden inference. Matching the tool's own summary text is not evidence."
 },
